{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789139459000-2284c1", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "今年社保基数调整了，帮写一段给全员的通知。", "id": "c88ec3e9ae9f4d2eb5a5a2cc69773492", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:10:59", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "4e4f1fde8fc844beab046983e8311d21", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:10:59", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "4558e7c80a614f859d76e28460f393e1", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:49"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**关于调整社保缴费基数的通知**\n各位同事：根据当地社平工资调整，自 X 月起社保缴费基数调整为下限 X 元、上限 X 元。工资中个人代缴部分将同步变化，详见工资条“社保代扣”项。如对基数有疑问，请联系人事部核对。", "id": "316adbedda894774b38602f29d6a8b74", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:49"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "59e6197e0cab46d0827b0057205d904c", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:07", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:11:49", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "有员工想按最低基数交，怎么答？", "id": "3b3ab6aa7f204c99b0ca295c6f5de3f8", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:14:59", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "5926f9fce3094dab8fc75b97c3137aa2", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:14:59", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "bb4867a6d8364854bdc7034c46462582", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:49"}, {"type": "text", "text": "答复口径：缴费基数必须按上年度月均工资申报，这是法定义务，不能自选最低档；如对申报数有异议可到人事部核对工资台账。避免口头答应按最低交，存在补缴+滞纳金风险。", "id": "bb637a034e2f4d5fbd557d7878c5fc5d", "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:07", "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:49"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "8816788b6e9941d6823fe470a26ff2ad", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:07", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-11T15:15:49", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}